OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department for Business,
OL,7,FInnovation, Science and Trade said the
OL,8,FTorcal would strengthen automotive
OL,9,Fsupply chains, as Bentley is supplied
OL,10,Fby more than 700 businesses including
OL,11,F82 within a 50-mile radius of its base.
